SUMMARY:2027 Social Security wage base of $192\,300 takes effect
DESCRIPTION:Social Security tax (12.4% for the self-employed) applies to 
 net self-employment earnings and wages up to $192\,300 in 2027. Medicare 
 tax has no cap.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/social-security
 -wage-base-2027-self-employed/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Mer
